config MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.semihost
    bool "semihost"
    depends on CPU_CORTEX_M
    help
      ARM semihosting host-call layer (BKPT 0xAB) plus a libc-free direct file
      API (SEMIHOST_Open/Read/Seek/Flen/Close; writes reuse SEMIHOST_Write),
      the toolchain-independent alternative to semihost_file. Cortex-M only.

config MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.semihost_console
    bool "semihost_console"
    depends on CPU_CORTEX_M
    select MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.semihost
    help
      Retargets the C library's low-level write (_write / __write / fputc) so
      standard printf/puts reach the debugger over semihosting. Coexists with
      debug_console: the SDK PRINTF stays on UART, C printf goes to semihosting.
      To route existing PRINTF sites instead, build -DSDK_DEBUGCONSOLE=0 and
      leave SDK_DEBUGCONSOLE_UART undefined (or prefer debug_console_semihost).

config MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.semihost_file
    bool "semihost_file"
    depends on CPU_CORTEX_M
    select MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.semihost_console
    help
      Retargets the C library's low-level file I/O (newlib _open/_read/...;
      IAR DLib __open/__read/...; ARM Compiler _sys_open/_sys_read/...) so
      standard fopen/fwrite/fread/fseek/fclose hit host files over semihosting.
      IAR needs --dlib_config DLib_Config_Full.h (Normal DLib omits FILE). Not
      available under MDK MicroLib (no file-system layer; compiles empty). The
      ARM Compiler branch is not CI-verified. For a libc-free alternative, use
      the direct SEMIHOST_* API in the base unit.

config MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.debug_console_semihost
    bool "debug_console_semihost"
    depends on CPU_CORTEX_M
    depends on !MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.debug_console && !MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.debug_console_lite && !MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.debug_console_rtt
    select MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.semihost
    select MCUX_COMPONENT_utility.str
    help
      Debug-console backend routing the SDK PRINTF to semihosting instead of a
      UART, replacing debug_console at the board level (unlike semihost_console,
      which only adds a _write override alongside the UART console). Ships its
      own fsl_debug_console.h; PRINTF maps to DbgConsole_Printf (a function, not
      the toolchain printf, so no -Wformat), with the 4-arg DbgConsole_Init so
      board files build unchanged. Mutually exclusive with the other
      debug_console variants.
